  "title": "Sage Pork Chops",
  "description": "Pork chops rubbed with a pungent seasoning of dried sage, salt and pepper are pan fried in butter until golden brown then simmered in a simple beef bouillon.",
  "authors": [
    "Tiffany Nixon"
  ],
